<section id="faq" class="py-20 px-4 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] gap-12">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand mb-3">FAQ</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-[-0.05em] mb-5">Pertanyaan umum sebelum apply.</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed">FAQ diletakkan dekat bawah seperti product page agar user punya jawaban sebelum klik bayar.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="faq-item card rounded-3xl p-6 open"><button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 text-left"><span class="font-black text-lg">Apakah visa pasti disetujui?</span><span class="faq-plus text-2xl font-light transition-transform">+</span></button><p class="faq-answer text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed mt-4">Keputusan akhir tetap di pihak kedutaan atau imigrasi. Kami membantu memastikan dokumen lebih lengkap dan sesuai syarat sebelum diajukan.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item card rounded-3xl p-6"><button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 text-left"><span class="font-black text-lg">Berapa lama proses visa?</span><span class="faq-plus text-2xl font-light transition-transform">+</span></button><p class="faq-answer text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed mt-4">Tergantung negara dan jenis visa. Setiap halaman visa menampilkan estimasi proses yang bisa dilihat sebelum mengajukan.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item card rounded-3xl p-6"><button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 text-left"><span class="font-black text-lg">Bagaimana kalau dokumen kurang?</span><span class="faq-plus text-2xl font-light transition-transform">+</span></button><p class="faq-answer text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed mt-4">Tim kami akan memberi catatan dokumen yang perlu dilengkapi sebelum proses pengajuan dilanjutkan.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item card rounded-3xl p-6"><button class="faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 text-left"><span class="font-black text-lg">Apakah bisa konsultasi dulu?</span><span class="faq-plus text-2xl font-light transition-transform">+</span></button><p class="faq-answer text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed mt-4">Bisa. Kamu bisa mulai dari form cek visa atau langsung chat konsultan melalui WhatsApp.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
